---
import DetailLayout from "../layouts/DetailLayout.astro";
import DevicePreview from "../components/DevicePreview.astro";
---

<DetailLayout
  title="Understanding change over time."
  eyebrow="Mobile application · In development"
  intro="Meridian Station is exploring how responsibly selected observations could help people recognize patterns and formulate better questions over time."
  feature
>
  <DevicePreview />
  <section aria-labelledby="mobile-context">
    <h2 id="mobile-context">Context matters.</h2>
    <p>
      Potential observations include movement, exercise, symptoms, sleep,
      environment, and other carefully selected measurements. More information
      is not automatically better; purpose, relevance, burden, missing context,
      and measurement quality all matter.
    </p>
    <p>
      Patterns would be prompts for further investigation—not proof of
      causation. Any future collection would require defined purposes, informed
      consent, and separate privacy safeguards.
    </p>
    <p class="product-caveat">
      This project is in development. It is not a clinical, diagnostic, or
      treatment product. This website does not collect mobile observations or
      enroll participants.
    </p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/research-approach/"
      >Read our research approach <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a
    >
  </section>
</DetailLayout>
